#     judgment call. Rather than just satisfying the gate syntactically,
#     added a real test that pins _CAPTION_LOCALES itself (the admit-list
#     array literal) and _resolveCaptionLocale()'s walk-then-fallback shape
#     — closing the actual gap AC-3 flagged (a dictionary entry present but
#     the locale absent from the admit-list would still silently resolve to
